Project Title: TechWords Fun – Learn Technology in a Fun Way

Project Overview
TechWords Fun is an interactive Weboreel-style learning website that introduces users to technology terms in a simple, humorous, and engaging way. Instead of presenting information like a traditional dictionary, the platform reveals each term through animated sections that feel similar to scrolling through short reels. The goal is to make learning technology vocabulary enjoyable and memorable using animations, playful explanations, and relaxing background music.

Concept
The website presents technology words one by one as the user scrolls. Each section introduces a new word along with a short, easy-to-understand, and sometimes funny explanation. This allows beginners to understand complex technical concepts without feeling overwhelmed. The experience should feel like exploring an entertaining learning reel rather than reading a static webpage.

Content Structure
To keep the experience interesting and avoid repetition, the website will contain around **50 different technology terms**. Each term will include:
• The technology word
• A short and simple explanation
• A small icon or emoji related to the concept
• Smooth animation when the word appears

